{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/my-Welcome_to_The_B.L.O.O.M_Initiative__1_.png?t=1744064406\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The B.L.O.O.M (Biotech Lethal Offensive Organic Munitions) Initiative</i> is a fast-paced <strong>2D top-down shoot 'em up</strong> where you pilot a drone through procedurally generated battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1744064406\" /> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ship_1_.gif?t=1744064406\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1744064406\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ship_1_.gif?t=1744064406\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1744064406\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Harvest, Build &amp; Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: <strong>gather resources, plant lethal bio-organisms, and defend your bases</strong> from relentless alien and native species on the hostile planet <strong>Shlee</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1744064406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>From Training to Total War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start in a basic training drone as you <strong>learn to build, plant, and fight</strong>, then dive into intense battles as two aggressive alien factions take an interest in your expanding operations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1744064406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade, Adapt, and Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your drone, adapt your strategies, and <strong>survive against overwhelming odds in this fusion of action and strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1744064406\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543740?t=1744064406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543740?t=1744064406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/53236b44ced4a9a85dba4c5d34f4f2ca9136f65b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744064406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/53236b44ced4a9a85dba4c5d34f4f2ca9136f65b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744064406","categories":[{"d